{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "target": "ES2017",
    "lib": [
      "dom",
      "dom.iterable",
      "esnext"
    ],
    "allowJs": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "strict": true,
    "noEmit": true,
    "esModuleInterop": true,
    "module": "esnext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "resolveJsonModule": true,
    "isolatedModules": true,
    "jsx": "preserve",
    "incremental": true,
    "plugins": [
      {
        "name": "next"
      }
    ],
    "paths": {
      "@/*": [
        "./src/*"
      ]
    }
  },
  "include": [
    "**/*.ts",
    "**/*.tsx",
    ".next/types/**/*.ts",
    "next-env.d.ts",
    "types/**/*.d.ts",
    ".next/next-build/types/**/*.ts"
  ],
  "exclude": [
    "node_modules"
  ]
}

PROJECT/STATE.md

Aureon — Codebase Analysis & Current State
Architecture Overview
Framework: Next.js 15.1.11 (App Router) + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v3.4.6
Font System: Geist Sans + Geist Mono (via geist package)
Notifications: sonner toast library
Charts: recharts with next/dynamic SSR-safe wrappers
Animations: framer-motion installed (not yet used in components — CSS animations used instead)
Icons: lucide-react
Additional: @tailwindcss/forms, tailwindcss-animate installed but not heavily used
