Design System
Color palette: Deep dark (#0a0a0f bg, #13131a card), Indigo primary (#6366f1), Violet accent (#8b5cf6)
Semantic colors: --positive (#10b981), --warning (#f59e0b), --danger (#ef4444), --info (#3b82f6)
Utility classes: glass-card, glass-card-elevated, gradient-primary, gradient-text, neon-glow, card-hover, blob-primary/accent/blue, grid-dots, status-dot-*, pulse-ring, animate-float, animate-shimmer
Typography: text-hero-xl, text-hero-lg (clamp-based responsive), tabular-nums
Border radius: CSS variable --radius: 12px
