Reusable Patterns to Continue With
All new pages wrap content in <AppLayout currentPath="/route">
KPI cards follow colorConfig pattern (bg/text/border/badge per color)
Charts use next/dynamic with ssr: false wrapper pattern
Tables use search + filter + sort + pagination pattern (see OrgManagementTable)
All interactive elements use suppressHydrationWarning + sonner toasts
Backend integration points are commented as // Backend integration point: fetch from /api/...
Status indicators use status-dot-* + pulse-ring CSS classes
Cards use card-hover class for hover lift effect
State Management
Local useState only — no global state manager (Redux/Zustand/Context) yet
No authentication layer implemented (Supabase keys present in .env but unused)
No real API calls — all data is static mock data in component files
Key Observations
framer-motion is installed but unused — CSS animations handle all motion currently
@tailwindcss/forms installed but not configured in tailwind.config.js plugins
Supabase env vars exist but are placeholder values — no Supabase client initialized
The app is fully dark-mode only (dark class on <html>)
All 10 missing routes will 404 currently — the not-found.tsx page handles this

